@@ -27,6 +27,14 @@
 Description
     Solver module for density-based solution of compressible flow
 
+    shockFluid (OpenFOAM 13) with one change, for steady runs under local
+    time stepping: with nOuterCorrectors 2 each time step is Heun's
+    two-stage, strong-stability-preserving Runge-Kutta step. The second
+    pass's mass, momentum and energy fluxes are the averages of the first
+    pass's (from the state at the step's start) and its own (from the first
+    pass's state), so the step is u + dt (R(u) + R(u + dt R(u)))/2, with the
+    time step fixed for the step. With nOuterCorrectors 1 it is shockFluid.
+
     Based on central-upwind schemes of Kurganov and Tadmor with support for
     mesh-motion and topology change.
 
